WEBVTT

NOTE Animated terminal (1280x720, dark slate) showing the Landify CLI
workflow. Cues are timed to the line animations in demo.svg.

00:00.900 --> 00:01.700
Command: landify new

00:01.700 --> 00:02.400
Output: Created landify.yaml

00:02.400 --> 00:03.100
Output: Next: landify validate

00:03.100 --> 00:04.300
Output: then: landify build

00:04.300 --> 00:05.300
Command: landify validate

00:05.300 --> 00:06.500
Output: landify.yaml is valid

00:06.500 --> 00:07.500
Command: landify build

00:07.500 --> 00:08.700
Output: Built index.html from landify.yaml

00:08.700 --> 00:09.700
Command: landify serve

00:09.700 --> 00:10.500
Output: Serving index.html on http://localhost:8080

00:10.500 --> 00:12.000
Output: Ctrl+C to stop

00:12.000 --> 00:14.800
Blank prompt
